    {
      "name": "Sage AI",
      "description": "Sage Java public APIs (`:8080`) and Graph RAG retrieve (`:8000`).\n\n**Prerequisites**\n1. Graph RAG on `:8000` (Neo4j up)\n2. Sage: `./mvnw spring-boot:run`\n3. Optional: Ollama for query interpretation\n\n**SSE tip:** For `POST /ask`, Postman shows the event stream in the response body.\n\nContracts: `docs/contracts/ask-api.md`, `docs/contracts/retrieve-api.md`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "item": [
